  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You place a holy ward on one willing creature within range. The next time that creature takes damage, the ward activates and the creature regains Hit Points equal to 1d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier. The ward then jumps to another ally of your choice within 30 feet of the warded creature, with the same effect. If no ally is within range, the spell ends; it also ends once the ward has healed five times.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The spell can heal one additional time for each spell slot level above 3.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-TccLv55dZvtAbTus\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Move the ward effect to the next ally by hand when it jumps.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
